1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
有种菌，人种不出，靠蚂蚁
One mushroom people can't grow — ants do

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
它叫鸡枞，菌中之王
It's jicong, king of mushrooms

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
只长在白蚁窝上
It grows only on termite nests

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
白蚁筑巢，养出菌丝
Termites build nests, farm the threads

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
巢里恒温、恒湿
The nest stays warm and moist

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
菌和蚁，谁也离不开谁
Fungus and ant — bound together

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
所以千百年种不出来
So for ages, no one could farm it

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
直到2024年昆明才出第一朵
Until 2024: Kunming grew the first

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
它有多鲜？
How fresh does it taste?

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
一口下去，鲜掉眉毛
One bite — impossibly savory

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
吃不完，熬成油鸡枞
Leftovers become oil-preserved jicong

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
下集：最丑的一朵，最贵
Next: the ugliest one — and priciest
